  "metadata": {
    "name": "floored",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "FLOORED: a Solana memecoin launchpad where the pool belongs to the holders. Any holder can redeem tokens for their exact share of the pool SOL (the floor); no sale can drop the price more than 20 % per minute (the brake). No admin withdrawal, no oracle, no LP token."
  },
